OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickens and lowers from the west with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain following, locally
OL,8,Fheavy through the early hours before
OL,9,Fclearing most places by dawn. Turning
OL,10,Fbreezy and remaining mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly rain clears to the
OL,13,Feast to leave another day of sunny
OL,14,Fspells and scattered, locally heavy
OL,15,Fand blustery, showers. Breezy for all.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFurther
OL,18,Fwet weather arriving by the afternoon
OL,19,Fon Friday. Patchy rain on Saturday,
OL,20,Fthen drier on Sunday with sunny spells
OL,21,Fbut blustery westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
